### 04 - Tasks - Create task (sukses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rancang skema database",
  "description": "Buat ERD dan tabel",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "{{futureDate}}",
  "projectId": "{{projectId}}"
}

### 04 - Tasks - Create task kedua (sukses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buat endpoint login",
  "projectId": "{{projectId}}"
}

