### 04 - Tasks - Get all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### 04 - Tasks - Get tasks - filter projectId & status
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?projectId={{projectId}}&status=todo

### 04 - Tasks - Get tasks - filter status tidak valid (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=ngawur

### 04 - Tasks - Get task by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

