PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 04 - Tasks - Update status - todo ke in_progress tanpa penugasan (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 05 - Task Assignments - Assign task ke 2 anggota sekaligus (sukses)
POST {{baseUrl}}/task-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{taskId}}",
  "memberIds": [
    "{{memberAId}}",
    "{{memberBId}}"
  ]
}

### 05 - Task Assignments - Assign - anggota sudah ditugaskan (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/task-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{taskId}}",
  "memberIds": [
    "{{memberAId}}"
  ]
}

### 05 - Task Assignments - Assign - anggota bukan dari tim proyek (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/task-assignments
