PATCH {{baseUrl}}/task-assignments/{{assignment2Id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "reviewer"
}

### 05 - Task Assignments - Update assignment - role tidak valid (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/task-assignments/{{assignment2Id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "bos"
}

### 05 - Task Assignments - Get task detail beserta anggota yang ditugaskan
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - todo -> in_progress (sukses, sudah ada penugasan)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - in_progress -> in_progress (400, status sama)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - in_progress -> done (400, lompat status)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - Status tidak valid (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ngawur"
}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - in_progress -> review (sukses)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "review"
}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - review -> done (sukses, completedAt terisi)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - Assign ke task yang sudah done (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/task-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "{{taskId}}",
  "memberIds": [
    "{{memberAId}}"
  ]
}

### 06 - Alur Status Task - Update status - task tidak ditemukan (404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

